{"id": "d005-001", "text": "Erin is now completely off gluten. Her doctor confirmed coeliac last month, so no more bringing her those almond croissants.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off gluten", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "doctor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month"}]}
{"id": "d005-003", "text": "Remind me to ask Manon how her mum's knee operation went on Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Manon how her mum's knee operation went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee operation", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-004", "text": "Victor supports Fulham and has had a season ticket for twenty years. He goes with his son every home game and they have the same pie and Bovril at half time, without fail. Do not mention the Brentford game. He's also really into fly fishing, goes up to the Tweed every September with his brother-in-law Graham, and ties all his own flies.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fulham", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twenty years"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pie and Bovril", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Brentford game", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes up to the Tweed every September", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother-in-law", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ties all his own flies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-011", "text": "Long chat with Joe after football. His dad has been in hospital since Sunday with pneumonia and Joe has been driving up to Leicester every evening after work. He sounded exhausted and said his sister Giulia is flying back from Milan on 11/2 to take over for a week. I should drop round some food for him this weekend, maybe that lamb curry he likes, and text him on Monday to see how his dad is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after football"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leicester", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Milan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/2", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food for him", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lamb curry", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-013", "text": "Kemal is vegan but eats honey, which I did not know. Also hates mushrooms with a passion.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats honey", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates mushrooms", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-015", "text": "Bethany's birthday is May 14. She's been dropping hints about a new set of watercolour brushes, the sable ones, because she's started painting seriously again since her daughter left for uni. She does landscapes mostly, and she's joined a class on Wednesday nights at the community centre. Her husband apparently got her a slow cooker last year and she has not forgiven him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new set of watercolour brushes, the sable ones", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "painting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left for uni", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "landscapes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "joined a class", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday nights"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "has not forgiven him", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-016", "text": "Dev and Sunil are doing the London to Brighton bike ride on Sunday. Dev's been training since April; Sunil has done about two rides.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "London to Brighton bike ride", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "training", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "d005-017", "text": "Rahul told me the trip to Kyoto with his parents is off because his mum broke her wrist. They might try again in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke her wrist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring"}]}
{"id": "d005-018", "text": "Tomás plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift. Their next gig is at the Crown on 12/6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/6", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-023", "text": "Dalia is obsessed with sourdough at the moment. Her starter is called Doughvid and she feeds it twice a day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "starter is called Doughvid", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a day"}]}
{"id": "d005-027", "text": "Tariq loves Arsenal, single malt whisky and terrible puns. Good to know for Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "single malt whisky", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "terrible puns", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "d005-029", "text": "Grocery list for Saturday: oat milk, chickpeas, coriander, two lemons. Meal prep Sunday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "oat milk", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chickpeas", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "coriander", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "two lemons", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Meal prep", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "a5"}]}
{"id": "d005-034", "text": "Joe Wright from the allotment grows chillies, about fourteen varieties. He gave me a jar of his scotch bonnet jam.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe Wright", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the allotment", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "grows chillies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d005-039", "text": "Sinead just got a place on the master's in archaeology at Galway, starting in September. She's thrilled. Send her congratulations, and maybe a book on Irish hill forts as a present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a place", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "master's in archaeology at Galway", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her congratulations", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a book on Irish hill forts", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-042", "text": "Phone call with Dev's mum this evening. Dev has been offered a promotion to head of engineering, starting May 1st, but he hasn't decided whether to take it because it means moving to Manchester. His girlfriend Olivia isn't keen. Must remember to call Dev before the weekend, and don't bring it up at Sunil's birthday drinks on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of engineering", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 1st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't keen", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Dev", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "d005-043", "text": "Rahul is the only person I know who genuinely likes durian. He also makes the best dal I have ever eaten, which he says is his nan's recipe and he won't share it. He's a huge chess nerd too, plays online every night and is about 1900 rated. His brother Sunil is apparently even better but refuses to play him anymore after some argument at Diwali.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "durian", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "about 1900 rated", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Diwali"}]}
{"id": "d005-045", "text": "Kaito Sato is doing the Tokyo marathon on 3/1. He wants to get under four hours this time, after missing it by two minutes last year. He's doing long runs every Sunday and has cut out beer completely until race day, which for Kaito is a huge sacrifice. His wife and both kids are going over with him and they'll stay on for a week afterwards to see her parents in Osaka. I should ask him next month how the training's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito Sato", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Tokyo marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to get under four hours", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long runs", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut out beer", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until race day"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay on", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-046", "text": "Graham's knee is playing up again, so he's had to stop playing walking football. He's quite down about it. Check in with him on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is playing up", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "walking football", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite down", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d005-047", "text": "Eamon passed his test! Fourth time lucky in the end. I should take him out for a pint to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed his test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a pint to celebrate", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d005-048", "text": "Long call with Olivia Reyes. Her dad, Dr Reyes, is finally retiring on June 30th, and the family are throwing him a party at the golf club that weekend. Her brother Joseph is flying in from Toronto on the 27th and staying for a fortnight. Olivia wants everyone to chip in for a set of new irons, so remind me to send her forty quid by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia Reyes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Reyes", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Toronto", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "set of new irons", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her forty quid", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
